"or whether the message was altered by a third party. <p> The receiver can "
"obtain your certificate from a central server, but you can also opt to "
"enclose your certificate with your message. You can select whether you do "
"not want to include a certificate at all, only your own certificate or the "
"whole chain of certificates that certify your own certificate, including or "
"excluding the root certificate. <p> It is recommended to always include at "
"least your own certificate with the message. <p> This setting is a default, "
"you can override it for each individual message. </qt>"
